Bentuk Perizinan Izin Pertambangan Rakya:
Form of Licensing: People's Mining License (Izin Pertambangan Rakyat / IPR)

Individual:

Application letter;
NIB (Business Identification Number);
Copy of the ID card (KTP);
Certificate from the local sub-district/village (kelurahan/desa) stating that the applicant is a local resident;
Statement letter undertaking to comply with the provisions of laws and regulations in the field of the environment and mining safety; and
Fiscal clearance certificate in accordance with the provisions of taxation laws and regulations.


Cooperative:

Application letter;
NIB (Business Identification Number);
Copy of the ID cards (KTP) of the cooperative's management;
Certificate from the local sub-district/village (kelurahan/desa) stating that all of the cooperative's management are local residents;
Statement letter of capability for environmental management and mining safety; and
Fiscal clearance certificate in accordance with the provisions of taxation laws and regulations.

