- the retail trade of fragrances (cologne, toilet water, perfume);
- the retail trade of hair cosmetics (shampoo, hair tonic, hair oil);
- the retail trade of nail cosmetics (base coat, nail polish, nail cream, cuticle remover); skin-care preparations (baby oil, cleansing lotion, masks, foot cream);
- the retail trade of cosmetics for body hygiene (spray deodorant, cream deodorant, douches);
- the retail trade of shaving products (shaving soap, shaving cream);
- the retail trade of traditional cosmetics (face powder, mangir, body scrub);
- the retail trade of other cosmetics, for example body powder, beauty cotton, and baby powder. For example, cosmetics stores.

