- the planting, care, and maintenance of plants for buildings (rooftop gardens, building-front greenery, indoor plants, etc.), sports grounds, playgrounds and other recreational grounds (sports fields, play areas, sunbathing areas and golf courses), as well as still and flowing water bodies (ponds, swimming pools, ditches, streams, drainage systems);
- the planting of plant vegetation for protection against sound or noise, wind, erosion, visibility, and heat or solar glare;
